row    B0B40Y09 1900 [42] scraped together a purse for you, %pcf. It
row    B0B40Y09 1900 [39] is not much - it is what the giant left
row    B0B40Y09 1900 [23] them. Will you take it?
label  B0B40Y09 1901 [29] I will. It was fairly earned.
label  B0B40Y09 1902 [28] No. Let them buy new cattle.
