label  B0B80Y17 1902 [30] Burn them, as the temple asks.
row    B0B50Y11 1900 [38] _nobleman_ is so pleased, %pcf, that a
row    B0B50Y11 1900 [39] fountain is to be raised with your name
row    B0B50Y11 1900 [43] carved upon it. Shall I tell _nobleman_ you
row    B0B50Y11 1900 [18] accept the honour?
