row    C0B00Y02 1900 [44] _item_ in hand. "It was only a game. _child_
row    C0B00Y02 1900 [38] played the part, and even _priest_ was
row    C0B00Y02 1900 [41] fooled. Take the thing back - only let me
row    C0B00Y02 1900 [42] go, and no one at __qgiver_ need ever know
row    C0B00Y02 1900 [9] my name."
label  C0B00Y02 1901 [18] Let _guardian_ go.
label  C0B00Y02 1902 [18] Expose _guardian_.
